WEBVTT

01:30.470 --> 01:34.940
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.259 --> 01:37.789
[Episode 30]

01:46.150 --> 01:47.039
Of course I do.

01:48.200 --> 01:49.000
Good.

01:50.000 --> 01:50.930
If the Demon King

01:51.070 --> 01:53.039
were to marry a human princess,

01:53.039 --> 01:54.789
peace between the two races

01:54.789 --> 01:55.509
would begin

01:55.680 --> 01:57.750
with the royal families.

01:58.070 --> 01:59.590
Wouldn't that be far better

01:59.590 --> 02:01.000
than your painstaking,

02:01.000 --> 02:03.560
gradual attempts to fix things?

02:03.840 --> 02:05.970
Father, you know what we are thinking?

02:07.310 --> 02:09.710
That is exactly what I want.

02:13.030 --> 02:13.750
However,

02:15.030 --> 02:16.710
I have one request.

02:19.120 --> 02:20.030
I'm all ears.

02:20.800 --> 02:21.750
I want you

02:23.120 --> 02:24.750
to find

02:25.400 --> 02:27.120
the ancient Kunlun Mirror.

02:28.930 --> 02:30.360
You want Yuli Spring?

02:30.360 --> 02:30.870
Yes.

02:31.240 --> 02:33.030
Let both races share Yuli Spring

02:33.030 --> 02:34.520
and enjoy eternal life.

02:34.750 --> 02:36.010
Even if you didn't ask,

02:36.630 --> 02:37.680
I would find

02:38.630 --> 02:40.430
Yuli Spring for Ning'an anyway.

02:41.310 --> 02:42.750
But finding it

02:43.030 --> 02:44.030
is no easy task.

02:44.470 --> 02:45.520
No, it isn't.

02:45.870 --> 02:47.270
Yet for the greater good,

02:47.430 --> 02:49.030
if the Demon King
is to marry a human princess,

02:49.030 --> 02:50.710
there must be something

02:50.710 --> 02:52.190
to convince everyone of his sincerity.

02:52.190 --> 02:53.050
How about this?

02:53.150 --> 02:55.590
If you can find the ancient Kunlun Mirror,

02:55.750 --> 02:56.680
I will order

02:56.870 --> 02:58.329
the Feiyu Guard disbanded

02:58.430 --> 03:00.430
and have those demon-hunting sects

03:00.430 --> 03:01.560
in the martial world

03:01.660 --> 03:04.450
turn into ordinary cultivation schools,

03:04.840 --> 03:06.970
never again harming innocent demons.

03:07.310 --> 03:08.430
On a personal level,

03:08.430 --> 03:11.190
humans live far shorter lives than demons,

03:11.870 --> 03:14.400
while demon cultivation
is long and arduous.

03:14.680 --> 03:17.410
I want my daughter, once married,

03:17.910 --> 03:20.110
to remain with you forever,

03:20.520 --> 03:23.400
not be a fleeting passerby
in your endless years.

03:24.520 --> 03:25.780
If you love each other,

03:26.470 --> 03:28.070
you shouldn't be separated.

03:37.180 --> 03:37.910
It's a deal.

03:38.880 --> 03:40.470
It's a deal.

03:43.520 --> 03:44.740
Your father's wish

03:45.120 --> 03:46.710
is exactly what I wish for too.

03:46.710 --> 03:48.110
Stay here and wait for me.

03:49.560 --> 03:51.490
You must be very careful.

03:51.590 --> 03:52.320
Don't worry.

03:53.240 --> 03:54.970
I can't bear to leave you alone.

04:14.520 --> 04:15.580
Thank you, Father.

04:19.079 --> 04:25.660
[Imperial Study]

04:28.000 --> 04:30.000
I haven't been a good father.

04:32.470 --> 04:34.510
If Hong Ye can fulfill his promise

04:36.040 --> 04:38.190
and bring happiness to my Ning'an,

04:39.120 --> 04:41.520
it will fulfill your mother's wish
as well.

05:18.710 --> 05:22.430
[Wedding]

05:35.870 --> 05:39.790
The Third Prince
sent a painting of Luoshui Goddess

05:40.120 --> 05:44.220
to congratulate Princess Ning'an
on her blessed marriage!

05:44.750 --> 05:50.390
Princess Suihe sent ten rolls of the
"Phoenix Being Paid Homage" brocade

05:50.480 --> 05:53.570
to wish Princess Ning'an
and the Demon King

05:53.630 --> 05:57.900
a joyful and harmonious life!

05:58.040 --> 06:03.080
Prince Jing's Mansion presented
a pair of white jade cups

06:03.310 --> 06:06.720
to celebrate the union
of Princess Ning'an and the Demon King,

06:06.720 --> 06:11.160
wishing them perfect harmony
and a happy marriage!

06:11.310 --> 06:12.500
Your Highness, you look stunning.

06:12.500 --> 06:14.510
This is truly what they call
beauty that topples kingdoms.

06:14.510 --> 06:15.120
No wonder

06:15.120 --> 06:17.310
even the Monarch of All Demons
has fallen for you.

06:17.310 --> 06:18.570
If I were a man,

06:18.630 --> 06:20.150
just one glimpse of you

06:20.190 --> 06:21.830
would make my life complete.

06:25.160 --> 06:26.830
In the year 248 of Tiansheng,

06:27.310 --> 06:29.510
the great demon Hong Ye
wreaked havoc in the human realm,

06:29.180 --> 06:34.380
[Great demon, Hong Ye]

06:30.160 --> 06:31.680
even breaching the imperial city

06:31.680 --> 06:33.480
and injuring countless people.

06:33.870 --> 06:36.510
Fortunately,
Princess Ning'an devised a strategy

06:34.490 --> 06:36.659
[History Record]

06:36.750 --> 06:38.600
and trapped him in an array.

06:36.780 --> 06:39.380
[Great demon, Hong Ye]

06:39.830 --> 06:41.430
Hong Ye fought desperately,

06:41.830 --> 06:43.950
but Princess Ning'an,
with great selflessness,

06:42.600 --> 06:46.010
[Princess Ning'an]

06:44.240 --> 06:45.950
sacrificed herself along with him

06:45.950 --> 06:47.510
to protect the people.

06:49.560 --> 06:52.950
His Majesty is here!

07:06.680 --> 07:08.520
Greetings, Father.

07:15.360 --> 07:16.160
So beautiful.

07:17.360 --> 07:18.490
On your wedding day,

07:18.800 --> 07:21.260
Hong Ye won't be able
to take his eyes off you.

07:23.070 --> 07:24.240
Before a royal wedding,

07:24.240 --> 07:26.640
imperial children must first accompany me

07:26.950 --> 07:30.210
to pay respects to the ancestors
of the Tiansheng Kingdom.

07:31.430 --> 07:32.000
Come.

07:34.800 --> 07:35.480
Yes.

07:40.340 --> 07:46.480
[Emperor Guangwu of the Tiansheng Kingdom]

07:41.480 --> 07:42.400
Here

07:42.600 --> 07:44.360
we enshrine our ancestors.

07:44.720 --> 07:46.450
Generation after generation,

07:46.600 --> 07:48.430
we grew from a small tribe,

07:49.390 --> 07:55.440
[Emperor Guangwu of the Tiansheng Kingdom]

07:49.510 --> 07:50.950
constantly clashing

07:51.270 --> 07:52.730
with neighboring tribes,

07:53.070 --> 07:54.630
enduring countless wars,

07:54.870 --> 07:56.680
piling up countless bones,

07:57.310 --> 07:59.310
defeating each opponent one by one,

08:01.160 --> 08:04.220
and finally unifying into
today's Tiansheng Kingdom.

08:10.430 --> 08:11.430
But compared

08:12.870 --> 08:14.930
with the wars against the demon race,

08:15.430 --> 08:17.120
all of this is nothing.

08:18.120 --> 08:20.050
The imperial descendants of today

08:21.310 --> 08:23.480
enjoy wealth and privilege in this palace

08:23.480 --> 08:26.240
only because these 17 ancestors

08:26.950 --> 08:30.080
and hundreds of royal clansmen
sacrificed their lives.

08:30.630 --> 08:34.000
They all fell in wars against the demons.

08:37.440 --> 08:39.039
As a kingdom grows stronger,

08:40.270 --> 08:42.120
its responsibility to resist demons

08:42.120 --> 08:44.510
only grows heavier.

08:45.150 --> 08:48.080
To lead humans
in completely eradicating the demons

08:48.480 --> 08:50.480
is the duty of the imperial clan.

08:53.440 --> 08:54.150
Ning'an,

08:55.840 --> 08:58.000
you carry royal blood as well.

08:58.670 --> 09:01.080
You must follow your destiny.

09:02.480 --> 09:03.480
You once said

09:03.480 --> 09:05.670
you wanted harmony between the two races.

09:05.670 --> 09:07.870
Why have you changed your stance today?

09:08.320 --> 09:09.360
Harmony?

09:10.200 --> 09:13.600
How can there be harmony
after a thousand years of bloodshed?

09:14.080 --> 09:16.150
How could I face our ancestors?

09:16.390 --> 09:18.120
And how could I face

09:18.720 --> 09:21.550
the countless bones gnawed clean
by the demons?

09:23.320 --> 09:23.780
Well...

09:24.320 --> 09:24.790
my mother...

09:24.790 --> 09:26.120
She was a demoness!

09:26.960 --> 09:29.890
She was sent by the demons
to disrupt the human court!

09:30.440 --> 09:32.430
Fortunately, I saw through her.

09:32.840 --> 09:33.960
After she gave birth to you,

09:33.960 --> 09:35.620
I killed her with my own hands,

09:36.630 --> 09:38.790
which only then secured my ascension
to the throne

09:38.790 --> 09:40.440
and ushered in a new era.

09:38.830 --> 09:41.560
[Emperor Guangwu of the Tiansheng Kingdom]

09:49.960 --> 09:50.910
Then why

09:51.550 --> 09:53.180
didn't you kill me as well?

09:53.240 --> 09:56.080
You are my own flesh and blood after all.

09:56.390 --> 09:59.240
I could not bear
to let you be implicated by that demon.

09:59.240 --> 10:01.670
I ordered that no one
speak of your origins.

10:01.840 --> 10:02.960
That is why there have been

10:02.960 --> 10:05.290
so many rumors in the palace
about your birth.

10:05.290 --> 10:06.120
It's just that...

10:06.120 --> 10:07.670
I never expected that,

10:09.000 --> 10:10.670
despite all precautions,

10:11.260 --> 10:14.650
you would still become entangled
with the Demon King.

10:17.600 --> 10:18.390
Ning'an,

10:20.730 --> 10:22.980
now is the time for you to choose.

10:24.240 --> 10:26.910
To completely cleanse your tainted blood,

10:26.910 --> 10:29.080
you must kill the Demon King for me

10:29.550 --> 10:31.820
and wipe out
the demon race for the human race.

10:31.820 --> 10:32.750
Only then can you prove yourself

10:32.750 --> 10:35.550
worthy of the title of princess
I bestowed upon you

10:35.550 --> 10:38.030
and worthy of our royal bloodline.

10:39.150 --> 10:41.460
I want you to swear before our ancestors

10:41.630 --> 10:42.890
that you and the demons

10:44.000 --> 10:45.320
are mortal enemies.

10:45.910 --> 10:47.300
What if I refuse?

10:53.440 --> 10:56.240
You have been close with the demons
for a long time.

10:57.080 --> 10:58.200
If Wang Hong hadn't told me

10:58.200 --> 11:00.000
that you are very familiar
with the demon realm

11:00.000 --> 11:01.150
and that you led the Demon King

11:01.150 --> 11:02.880
into the Feiyu Guard's ambush,

11:03.550 --> 11:05.870
your collusion with him
in and out of the imperial palace

11:05.870 --> 11:08.330
would have earned you death
many times over.

11:09.790 --> 11:12.910
You should be thanking the Demon King
for sending you back,

11:12.910 --> 11:14.640
or you wouldn't be alive today.

11:17.320 --> 11:18.130
So

11:18.550 --> 11:20.350
if I had returned alone that day,

11:20.720 --> 11:22.320
I would have certainly died.

11:22.630 --> 11:24.360
But if Hong Ye came back with me,

11:24.480 --> 11:26.280
it meant I still had value to you.

11:26.580 --> 11:29.180
You were counting
on Hong Ye's feelings for me,

11:29.200 --> 11:30.910
staging a touching act

11:31.150 --> 11:32.630
just to deceive him into

11:32.710 --> 11:34.510
finding the Kunlun Mirror for you,

11:34.510 --> 11:36.970
so you could claim
Yuli Spring for yourself.

11:37.750 --> 11:39.460
Having a father like you

11:39.480 --> 11:40.630
is my greatest curse.

11:40.630 --> 11:41.000
You...

11:41.000 --> 11:41.840
I advise you

11:42.510 --> 11:44.320
to abandon your scheme

11:44.390 --> 11:46.100
and keep your promises to Hong Ye.

11:46.100 --> 11:46.820
Otherwise,

11:47.080 --> 11:48.750
he will surely raze your imperial palace
to the ground.

11:48.750 --> 11:49.960
I also advise you

11:50.360 --> 11:51.910
to kill the Demon King for me

11:51.910 --> 11:54.040
and draw the map of the Demons' Valley!

11:54.750 --> 11:57.110
I'm giving you one last chance!

12:12.200 --> 12:13.000
Guards.

12:18.870 --> 12:20.150
Your Majesty, you are wise.

12:20.150 --> 12:22.630
You know Princess Ning'an
has been unruly since childhood

12:22.630 --> 12:24.030
and lacks any sense of duty or honor,

12:24.030 --> 12:26.960
so you ordered the Master to spend over
a month creating this puppet talisman.

12:26.960 --> 12:28.000
With this,

12:28.020 --> 12:30.510
everything can proceed according to plan

12:30.510 --> 12:33.550
without delaying Your Majesty's
grand design.

12:37.480 --> 12:40.200
How could I entrust such a task

12:40.960 --> 12:43.230
to the bastard of a lowly beast-tamer?

12:43.480 --> 12:44.960
Once I kill the Demon King

12:45.480 --> 12:47.610
and obtain the ancient Kunlun Mirror,

12:48.120 --> 12:51.120
whether you want to continue being
a princess in the Cold Palace

12:51.120 --> 12:53.150
or follow that demon in death

12:55.510 --> 12:56.790
is all up to you.

13:18.720 --> 13:19.320
My Lord,

13:20.000 --> 13:21.260
can that human emperor

13:21.390 --> 13:22.270
be trusted?

13:23.360 --> 13:25.290
I remain wary of the human emperor,

13:25.910 --> 13:27.040
but I trust Ning'an.

13:30.480 --> 13:30.960
My Lord,

13:31.320 --> 13:32.030
how about...

13:32.030 --> 13:32.870
I accompany you

13:32.870 --> 13:34.070
to welcome the bride?

13:34.630 --> 13:37.030
You stay here
and guard the Demons' Valley.

13:37.220 --> 13:39.350
Even if the humans try to do something,

13:40.000 --> 13:41.600
they can't do anything to me.

13:57.570 --> 13:58.430
Stop sleeping.

13:58.750 --> 14:00.010
Come out and talk to me.

14:04.270 --> 14:06.330
Why did you call me out?

14:06.390 --> 14:08.030
Didn't you hear what His Lordship said?

14:08.030 --> 14:10.120
He told us to stay put
in the Demons' Valley,

14:10.120 --> 14:11.600
so let's just stay here.

14:11.720 --> 14:13.650
Otherwise, he'll get angry again.

14:16.500 --> 14:17.150
But

14:18.320 --> 14:20.000
I still can't shake

14:20.190 --> 14:21.390
this uneasy feeling.

14:21.540 --> 14:22.810
I feel that this trip

14:23.750 --> 14:25.750
will be dangerous for His Lordship.

14:28.240 --> 14:28.900
Look at you,

14:29.030 --> 14:30.360
overthinking again.

14:30.750 --> 14:32.200
Who in this world could put His Lordship

14:32.200 --> 14:33.880
in danger?

14:34.080 --> 14:36.140
Why dwell on such pointless worries?

14:40.360 --> 14:41.890
I just can't stop worrying.

14:42.150 --> 14:42.900
Stop talking nonsense.

14:42.900 --> 14:44.100
Are you coming or not?

14:46.870 --> 14:47.530
Fine, fine.

14:47.740 --> 14:49.000
I can't argue with you.

14:49.480 --> 14:50.870
Go by yourself if you want to go,

14:50.870 --> 14:52.200
but don't drag me along.

14:53.440 --> 14:55.530
Remember to keep your distance.

14:55.570 --> 14:58.060
If His Lordship finds out,
he'll be angry again.

14:58.060 --> 14:59.580
[Yong'an Palace]

14:59.660 --> 15:02.250
[Wedding]

15:08.610 --> 15:11.080
How exactly can I break
this puppet talisman?

15:11.080 --> 15:12.080
Time is running out.

15:12.080 --> 15:13.090
What should I do?

15:18.320 --> 15:20.440
Greetings, Your Highness.

15:20.560 --> 15:23.450
Congratulations on your wedding day.

15:29.790 --> 15:30.730
Mocui,

15:31.070 --> 15:32.870
isn't Her Highness already dressed?

15:32.870 --> 15:34.480
Don't miss the auspicious time.

15:34.480 --> 15:35.360
It's done.

15:41.150 --> 15:43.440
Auspicious clouds surround the halls,

15:43.470 --> 15:46.070
and joy fills the courtyard.

15:47.320 --> 15:49.810
Your Highness, please rise.

16:01.750 --> 16:02.360
No.

16:03.360 --> 16:04.890
Hong Ye, please don't come.

16:13.250 --> 16:17.290
[Wedding]

16:29.360 --> 16:30.510
Why isn't Ning'an here yet?

16:30.510 --> 16:32.240
She should have arrived by now.

16:32.430 --> 16:33.980
I've already sent someone to fetch her.

16:33.980 --> 16:35.030
Hurry her up again.

16:35.030 --> 16:35.550
Yes.

16:35.670 --> 16:36.870
Go fetch her quickly.

16:37.080 --> 16:37.630
Yes.

16:39.000 --> 16:41.240
I hope the Master
hasn't made any mistakes.

16:41.240 --> 16:44.200
The Demon King has arrived!

17:15.400 --> 17:17.260
Thank you for coming, Demon King.

17:26.270 --> 17:27.069
So this is...

17:27.730 --> 17:29.260
the ancient Kunlun Mirror?

17:30.400 --> 17:31.130
Indeed it is.

17:37.510 --> 17:38.310
Your Majesty,

17:39.110 --> 17:40.110
where is Ning'an?

17:41.920 --> 17:42.580
Ning'an...

17:42.750 --> 17:44.110
is still getting ready.

17:44.480 --> 17:47.410
She wants to be the most beautiful bride
in the world.

17:50.270 --> 17:51.160
My dear son-in-law,

17:51.160 --> 17:52.760
this ancient Kunlun Mirror—

17:53.110 --> 17:53.790
may I...

17:54.240 --> 17:55.500
take a look at it first?

17:59.750 --> 18:00.440
This mirror

18:01.070 --> 18:02.870
represents my love for Ning'an.

18:03.920 --> 18:04.850
When she's here,

18:06.240 --> 18:08.040
I will give it to her personally.

18:10.590 --> 18:11.190
Very well.

18:11.750 --> 18:12.480
Very well.

18:13.830 --> 18:14.690
Your Highness,

18:14.960 --> 18:16.200
it's time.

18:19.400 --> 18:20.260
Your Highness,

18:20.640 --> 18:22.520
if we miss the auspicious time,

18:22.880 --> 18:23.750
we servants

18:24.110 --> 18:25.920
will be severely punished.

18:32.000 --> 18:33.000
I can't go.

18:41.930 --> 18:43.060
As long as I don't go,

18:43.640 --> 18:44.960
Hong Ye will be safe.

18:58.270 --> 18:59.590
Where is Ning'an?

19:10.400 --> 19:11.260
I'm asking you.

19:12.830 --> 19:14.410
Where is Ning'an?

19:14.720 --> 19:15.920
Protect His Majesty!

19:26.950 --> 19:27.980
Her Highness

19:28.240 --> 19:30.520
has already sworn before the ancestors

19:30.640 --> 19:31.310
of the Tiansheng Kingdom

19:31.310 --> 19:32.910
to eradicate all the demons.

19:32.960 --> 19:34.270
I kept my promise,

19:35.440 --> 19:37.770
but you humans
have gone back on your word.

19:37.960 --> 19:38.920
Tell me

19:39.920 --> 19:41.620
where Ning'an is,

19:42.790 --> 19:44.790
and I'll spare your lives.

19:46.000 --> 19:46.460
Attack!

20:25.240 --> 20:25.720
Hurry!

20:26.110 --> 20:28.310
Put on the bridal veil for Her Highness.

20:45.510 --> 20:48.000
If anything happens to Ning'an,

20:50.310 --> 20:52.680
I will destroy this capital.

21:47.620 --> 21:48.240
Ning'an!

21:49.440 --> 21:50.370
Are you alright?

22:07.670 --> 22:10.270
I have found the ancient Kunlun Mirror
for you.

22:10.880 --> 22:11.920
I also promised

22:12.550 --> 22:14.610
to help humans achieve immortality.

22:15.000 --> 22:16.200
And I'll keep my word.

22:31.410 --> 22:32.030
Ning'an,

22:32.390 --> 22:33.830
what exactly happened?

22:35.340 --> 22:36.180
Hong Ye,

22:36.790 --> 22:38.310
look at me carefully.

22:39.640 --> 22:41.440
My body doesn't belong to me now.

22:43.110 --> 22:44.780
Look into my eyes.

22:46.310 --> 22:47.310
Demons

22:47.750 --> 22:50.610
are a scourge
that all are duty-bound to eradicate.

22:51.030 --> 22:51.960
Demons

22:52.590 --> 22:55.450
are a scourge
that all are duty-bound to eradicate.

23:01.820 --> 23:03.120
Everything in the past

23:04.150 --> 23:06.630
was merely to disturb your mind.

23:49.030 --> 23:50.310
Don't come any closer.

23:51.030 --> 23:51.790
No.

23:52.170 --> 23:53.430
Eight Yang Formation!

24:03.850 --> 24:06.360
[Wedding]

24:06.880 --> 24:07.510
Demon!

24:07.960 --> 24:10.270
I have sealed your power
with the Eight Yang Formation!

24:10.270 --> 24:11.580
Surrender at once!

24:19.000 --> 24:20.000
Hong Ye,

24:20.720 --> 24:21.920
go!

24:26.240 --> 24:27.620
Don't come any closer!

24:31.070 --> 24:33.690
You claim to love me truly.

24:33.960 --> 24:34.970
If you do,

24:35.110 --> 24:36.180
then for my sake,

24:37.160 --> 24:38.940
give up your power!

24:39.640 --> 24:40.570
I can't say that.

24:40.970 --> 24:41.900
Absolutely not.

24:53.550 --> 24:55.790
Kill him! Kill him!

24:56.110 --> 24:58.760
Get the ancient Kunlun Mirror back for me!

25:03.310 --> 25:04.110
Hong Ye!

25:29.960 --> 25:30.960
Go now.

25:31.960 --> 25:32.790
Just leave me behind.

25:32.790 --> 25:34.320
Why aren't you leaving?

25:34.510 --> 25:35.440
Pipa Hook!

25:55.720 --> 25:56.550
Hong Ye,

25:58.000 --> 25:59.480
I brought this to you.

26:00.440 --> 26:03.580
♪ Fear that the red thread that bound us,
the vows we engraved ♪

26:04.670 --> 26:07.970
♪ The "forever" we swore are
meant to miss their mark ♪

26:14.380 --> 26:17.800
♪ Afraid of the exchanged life and death,
the arrows blocking the way ♪

26:18.650 --> 26:22.960
♪ The chains that are hard to break,
hard to distinguish ♪

26:26.380 --> 26:28.610
♪ Perhaps it's all for nothing ♪

26:29.910 --> 26:32.170
♪ Love and hate are nothing more ♪

26:32.990 --> 26:37.240
♪ Than a scene we rush through ♪

26:40.610 --> 26:42.860
♪ Afraid of giving my true heart ♪

26:43.950 --> 26:46.380
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

26:48.840 --> 26:50.770
♪ Boiling hot ♪

26:55.480 --> 26:59.810
♪ You and I are like grass and trees
meeting in the depths of the clouds ♪

27:00.800 --> 27:05.030
♪ Like the red thread strung together,
hanging on a sharp sword ♪

27:06.160 --> 27:08.940
♪ Waiting for the heartbeat
to shatter time ♪

27:10.090 --> 27:11.470
♪ The chains of fate ♪

27:12.440 --> 27:16.090
♪ Belong to us, in the blink of an eye,
it's 1,000 years ♪

27:14.400 --> 27:16.590
This is the most beautiful sunset
I've ever seen.

27:16.590 --> 27:17.830
Is it because we're up high?

27:17.120 --> 27:20.530
♪ You and I meet across mountains
and rivers, under the bright moon ♪

27:18.880 --> 27:20.340
It's because you're here.

27:20.720 --> 27:21.990
Demons eat people.

27:21.590 --> 27:23.010
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

27:22.070 --> 27:23.120
But you don't.

27:23.590 --> 27:25.880
What if my father truly detains me

27:24.210 --> 27:25.490
♪ Both flushing ♪

27:25.880 --> 27:26.880
and I cannot get out?

27:26.570 --> 27:30.060
♪ Waiting to walk hand in hand
through the chessboard of fate ♪

27:26.880 --> 27:28.400
Then I will come and rescue you.

27:28.400 --> 27:29.380
What if I...

27:29.560 --> 27:31.660
no longer exist in this world?

27:31.220 --> 27:36.140
♪ The carefree moments that belong to us ♪

27:31.960 --> 27:33.820
Why are you suddenly asking this?

27:34.380 --> 27:35.720
I just want to know.

27:37.090 --> 27:38.900
What if... I die?

27:38.510 --> 27:40.300
♪ Moments ♪

27:59.960 --> 28:04.140
♪ You and I are like grass and trees
meeting in the depths of the clouds ♪

28:00.750 --> 28:02.000
Great Mercy!

28:05.240 --> 28:09.390
♪ Like the red thread strung together,
hanging on a sharp sword ♪

28:10.650 --> 28:13.240
♪ Waiting for the heartbeat
to shatter time ♪

28:14.540 --> 28:16.020
♪ The chains of fate ♪

28:16.920 --> 28:20.580
♪ Belong to us, in the blink of an eye,
it's 1,000 years ♪

28:21.600 --> 28:25.030
♪ You and I meet across mountains
and rivers, under the bright moon ♪

28:26.070 --> 28:27.490
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

28:28.400 --> 28:29.350
Hong Ye!

28:28.590 --> 28:30.010
♪ Both flushing ♪

28:31.050 --> 28:34.480
♪ Waiting to walk hand in hand
through the chessboard of fate ♪

28:35.700 --> 28:40.440
♪ The carefree moments that belong to us ♪

28:43.800 --> 28:47.340
♪ Moments ♪

28:44.480 --> 28:45.210
What if I...

28:45.720 --> 28:47.510
no longer exist in this world?

28:48.110 --> 28:50.170
Then I will find you in your next life.

28:50.310 --> 28:51.280
Kill him!

28:51.310 --> 28:52.240
Kill him!

28:52.640 --> 28:53.920
Get the ancient Kunlun Mirror

28:53.920 --> 28:55.360
back for me!

28:55.400 --> 28:57.710
Slay that demon immediately!

29:34.940 --> 29:37.610
♪ A thousand years have flowed by ♪

29:37.470 --> 29:38.200
Xiao Yao,

29:39.000 --> 29:40.110
if you're in danger,

29:39.160 --> 29:41.250
♪ Turning into tears
that brim over my eyes ♪

29:40.480 --> 29:41.740
don't force yourself.

29:42.810 --> 29:44.960
♪ And the moonlight to heal sorrow ♪

29:46.200 --> 29:48.920
♪ The sweetness of the world
always tastes like the first time ♪

29:50.160 --> 29:53.090
♪ The joys and sorrows in my dreams ♪

29:52.960 --> 29:55.010
If I looked nothing like her,

29:54.390 --> 29:56.680
♪ Transformed into a farewell song,
stirring the soul ♪

29:55.070 --> 29:57.130
would you still protect me like this?

29:58.060 --> 30:00.470
♪ And into wind and rain,
drifting and swirling ♪

30:01.550 --> 30:03.800
♪ The ship of fate
always faces the waves ♪

30:05.070 --> 30:08.140
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

30:09.140 --> 30:11.460
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

30:12.500 --> 30:15.700
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

30:16.270 --> 30:16.880
Who...

30:16.820 --> 30:18.900
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

30:18.720 --> 30:20.000
are you, really?

30:20.080 --> 30:23.430
♪ From now on, the moon fears waning,
the waves long for the returning tide ♪

30:24.330 --> 30:26.730
♪ I carry an extra touch of care
in my heart and on my brow ♪

30:26.790 --> 30:27.510
Ning'an,

30:27.560 --> 30:31.000
♪ From now on,
with reckless courage and mutual longing ♪

30:30.680 --> 30:32.470
let me ask you one last question.

30:32.250 --> 30:37.290
♪ Giving up three lives of marriage
just for ♪

30:33.750 --> 30:34.790
Have you ever—

30:37.550 --> 30:39.510
even for a moment,

30:42.590 --> 30:43.830
even just a little—

30:46.790 --> 30:48.030
truly loved me?

30:52.830 --> 30:53.590
Never.

30:58.560 --> 31:01.570
♪ The joys and sorrows in my dreams ♪

31:02.790 --> 31:05.120
♪ Transformed into a farewell song,
stirring the soul ♪

31:03.660 --> 31:05.020
So what is your name?

31:05.640 --> 31:06.510
My name is Ning'an.

31:06.460 --> 31:08.910
♪ And into wind and rain,
drifting and swirling ♪

31:09.950 --> 31:12.280
♪ The ship of fate
always faces the waves ♪

31:10.640 --> 31:11.950
My name is Xiao Yao.

31:13.470 --> 31:16.540
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

31:17.540 --> 31:20.140
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

31:20.900 --> 31:24.190
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

31:25.220 --> 31:27.390
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

31:28.480 --> 31:31.900
♪ From now on, the moon fears waning,
the waves long for the returning tide ♪

31:32.730 --> 31:35.310
♪ I carry an extra touch of care
in my heart and on my brow ♪

31:35.960 --> 31:39.440
♪ From now on,
with reckless courage and mutual longing ♪

31:40.650 --> 31:46.110
♪ Giving up three lives of marriage
just for ♪

31:50.250 --> 31:51.310
♪ Our wishes ♪

31:59.680 --> 32:00.640
Hong Ye!

32:01.880 --> 32:02.590
Hong Ye!

32:06.590 --> 32:07.990
Move!

32:08.160 --> 32:09.350
Move!

32:10.640 --> 32:11.640
Where is the ancient mirror?

32:11.640 --> 32:13.240
Where is the ancient mirror?

32:13.640 --> 32:15.720
Where is my ancient mirror?

32:16.920 --> 32:18.180
The ancient mirror...

32:18.240 --> 32:19.030
Mine...

32:19.640 --> 32:21.190
Where is my ancient mirror?

32:21.480 --> 32:23.190
Where is the ancient mirror?

32:25.430 --> 32:27.040
The ancient Kunlun Mirror!

32:28.200 --> 32:29.900
The ancient Kunlun Mirror!

32:37.480 --> 32:38.480
My ancient mirror!

32:38.480 --> 32:40.020
My ancient Kunlun Mirror!

32:40.070 --> 32:42.210
My ancient mirror!

32:54.750 --> 32:57.070
Is this a tear-essence of yours?

32:57.880 --> 32:59.620
To leave is to return.

32:59.750 --> 33:01.280
To come is to depart.

33:01.830 --> 33:03.240
My parting from you

33:05.660 --> 33:07.720
is but a prelude to our first meeting.

33:10.310 --> 33:11.070
Xiao Yao.

33:11.720 --> 33:13.230
Just remember—

33:13.590 --> 33:14.370
you

33:14.440 --> 33:15.960
have always been you.

33:38.040 --> 33:39.580
Issue my decree.

33:39.680 --> 33:41.800
Mobilize all forces across the realm

33:41.820 --> 33:43.550
to eliminate the demons!

33:45.750 --> 33:47.230
All that I once envied,

33:47.650 --> 33:48.420
minded,

33:48.800 --> 33:49.860
and was jealous of,

33:50.830 --> 33:52.560
was myself all along.

33:54.950 --> 33:55.790
I...

33:55.920 --> 33:57.200
am Ning'an.

33:59.880 --> 34:00.510
Hong Ye,

34:01.550 --> 34:02.390
wait for me.

34:04.510 --> 34:05.910
I want to face everything

34:06.200 --> 34:07.920
again with you.

34:22.250 --> 34:23.630
[Tianwei Gate]

34:24.550 --> 34:25.150
[Tianwei Gate]

34:34.400 --> 34:36.350
Before he died, he entrusted me

34:37.060 --> 34:39.909
with finding you no matter what.

34:41.260 --> 34:42.840
Now that you've found me,

34:43.280 --> 34:44.560
what can you even do?

34:44.590 --> 34:45.480
Save you...

34:47.020 --> 34:49.000
from this misery.

34:50.960 --> 34:53.370
As long as you release Lu Pianpian,

34:53.800 --> 34:55.530
I'm willing to help Dreamshard

34:56.969 --> 34:59.430
collect
the fragments of the Kunlun Mirror.

35:01.550 --> 35:04.010
I only want you to remember Lu Pianpian,

35:04.800 --> 35:07.200
not some heartless, cold-blooded spirit.

35:08.300 --> 35:11.010
I will only care
about the three of us from now on.

35:19.230 --> 35:21.350
Lu Pianpian doesn't exist anymore.

35:22.880 --> 35:25.060
Only the Dreamshard Immortal does.

36:39.320 --> 36:39.950
My Lord.

36:40.960 --> 36:42.360
We tried all the previous routes

36:42.360 --> 36:43.510
to the Demons' Valley,

36:43.510 --> 36:45.110
and none of them works anymore.

36:45.110 --> 36:45.960
The demons are cunning.

36:45.960 --> 36:46.880
They must have

36:46.880 --> 36:48.010
set up a new barrier.

36:48.590 --> 36:49.590
Without an insider,

36:49.590 --> 36:51.030
entering the Demons' Valley

36:51.030 --> 36:52.560
will take us much more time.

37:12.480 --> 37:13.410
Bingzhu,

37:13.760 --> 37:16.010
I planted Shadow Poison in Tan'er.

37:16.290 --> 37:18.520
Through her body, you and I

37:19.670 --> 37:21.000
can share our thoughts.

37:23.040 --> 37:25.050
This battle must be won in one strike.

37:25.050 --> 37:26.710
There is no second chance.

37:27.000 --> 37:28.770
Every moment you delay

37:28.950 --> 37:31.250
gives the demons more time to prepare.

37:31.470 --> 37:33.540
Do not hesitate for even a second.

37:34.030 --> 37:35.140
No matter the cost,

37:37.510 --> 37:39.110
victory is all that matters.

37:39.930 --> 37:40.500
My Lord.

37:42.630 --> 37:43.190
My Lord?

37:45.030 --> 37:46.500
Bring the Lotus Staff.

37:48.150 --> 37:49.510
The barrier hasn't been opened yet.

37:49.510 --> 37:50.560
Do we need it now?

37:51.400 --> 37:53.960
Since we can't find the entrance
to this barrier,

37:53.960 --> 37:55.440
we'll use the Lotus Array

37:55.440 --> 37:57.400
to smash this barrier to pieces.

38:03.630 --> 38:04.240
My Lord.

38:05.000 --> 38:05.920
The Lotus Array

38:06.000 --> 38:08.460
is powered by the essence
of the Feiyu Guard.

38:08.550 --> 38:09.840
If we force it

38:09.880 --> 38:11.340
to smash open the barrier,

38:11.670 --> 38:13.440
I fear that by the time
the great demon shows himself,

38:13.440 --> 38:14.630
our brothers' essence

38:14.630 --> 38:16.070
will already be exhausted.

38:16.070 --> 38:19.200
The Feiyu Guards have been blessed
by the Immortal Lord.

38:19.760 --> 38:21.710
Shouldn't every one of you now

38:22.580 --> 38:24.330
be able to take on a hundred?

38:28.400 --> 38:29.000
Yes.

38:32.550 --> 38:33.760
Bring the magical weapon!

38:33.760 --> 38:34.310
Yes!

39:16.230 --> 39:16.960
Sir!

39:17.000 --> 39:17.710
Sir!

39:17.920 --> 39:18.360
Stop!

39:18.360 --> 39:19.180
Sir!

39:19.400 --> 39:19.840
Stop!

39:20.400 --> 39:20.840
Stop!

39:23.670 --> 39:24.280
Don't cause trouble!

39:24.280 --> 39:24.630
Step back!

39:24.630 --> 39:25.830
Don't cause trouble!

39:26.280 --> 39:28.110
Please spare us, sir!

39:29.400 --> 39:30.630
Our whole family is doomed!

39:30.630 --> 39:31.320
Step back!

39:31.510 --> 39:32.280
Sir!

39:33.280 --> 39:34.560
Sir!

39:38.210 --> 39:39.720
Ask yourself—

39:40.480 --> 39:41.790
if we lose this battle,

39:42.480 --> 39:44.130
will the price
really be just a few households

39:44.130 --> 39:46.130
and a few hundred acres of farmland?

39:53.930 --> 39:54.480
Go!

39:55.280 --> 39:55.800
Hurry!

39:56.840 --> 39:57.280
Go!

39:57.640 --> 39:58.190
Go!

39:58.480 --> 39:59.840
You will pay for this!

39:59.840 --> 40:00.700
Hurry up and go!

40:05.000 --> 40:05.570
Hong Ye,

40:06.280 --> 40:07.870
do you think that by sealing us away
for 10,000 years,

40:07.870 --> 40:09.800
you could claim the world for yourself?

40:09.800 --> 40:11.250
Today I will show you

40:11.550 --> 40:13.280
what true endless death means.

40:14.000 --> 40:16.040
I'd like to skin him alive,

40:16.330 --> 40:18.000
stuff his skin with his own hair,

40:18.000 --> 40:19.360
and make a football to play with.

40:19.360 --> 40:21.290
That would be too merciful for him.

40:22.030 --> 40:24.090
I want to carve the flesh from his body

40:24.320 --> 40:26.260
slice by slice,

40:26.760 --> 40:28.640
each piece paper-thin.

40:29.070 --> 40:30.250
You two, stand down.

40:30.800 --> 40:32.400
Just watch.

40:32.920 --> 40:33.740
Ao Hen!

40:34.070 --> 40:35.230
All of us were sealed away
for 10,000 years.

40:35.230 --> 40:36.480
What gives you the right to act alone?

40:36.480 --> 40:37.130
Shut up!
